MODULE 4: WHAT IS EXPLAINABILITY?
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION:

- An AI system is explainable when everyday people, who do not have any special training in AI,
    can understand how and why the system came to a particular prediction or recommendation.
    Explainability is like showing your work on a math problem so that everyone can see the steps
    you took to get your answer.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

    - After completing this module, you should be able to:
        -> Describe explainability
        -> Describe interpretability
        -> Compare interpretability and explainability